  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "智代子……そんなに落ち込むな\r\n参加者も多かったし、こういう時もある",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040020,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……でも……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040030,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……はっ！　も、もしかして、\r\nみんな、チョコアイドルに飽きちゃったんじゃ……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、そんなことは……",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040040,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "このままじゃダメですよね！？\r\n停滞はよくないって聞きました！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040050,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "路線変更、してみます！\r\nチョコアイドル以外のアイドルになります！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040060,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、ちょっと\r\n練習させてもらってもいいですか？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ……",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040070,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "じゃあいきますね！\r\nこほんっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……私は園田智代子よ。会えて光栄に思うことね\r\nだって私は将来、世界一になるアイドルなんだから",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……えっと、それは……",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040090,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "キリッとしたお嬢様キャラです、どうですか！？\r\nそれから、えっと……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040100,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……園田……智代子……です\r\n好きなもの、は……お菓子と、ご飯……です……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは、寡黙キャラ……とか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040110,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "わあ、プロデューサーさん、アタリです！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040120,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……でもな、こんなんでアタシを分かった気になってたら\r\n痛い目見んぞ。気ぃつけろよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "次はヤンキーキャラ、と……",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040130,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "これだけあったら、飽きられちゃったりしないですよねっ\r\n……今度の握手会で、色々チャレンジしてみます！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうだな。せっかく考えたんだから、\r\nきちんと試しておいで",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
