  {
    "id": 1010001040140,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "うぅ～……全然しっくりきませんでした……！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040150,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ファンのみんなや、メンバーのみんなにも\r\n心配されたり笑われたりしちゃいましたし……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "とりあえず、お疲れ様",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040160,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "いろんなキャラを試したのに……\r\n一体何がダメだったんでしょう……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "智代子……",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "智代子が落ち着く\r\nスタイルは？",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "ファンはなんて\r\n言ってた？",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "本当は気づいてるん\r\nじゃないか？",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "智代子が落ち着く\r\nスタイルは？",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040170,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "え？　えっと……私が落ち着くのは、\r\n甘いものを持って、チョコのことを話して……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040180,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あ……これって……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040190,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そっか……やっぱり、私、チョコアイドルなんですね\r\nチョコが一番、ぴったりに思えました！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、俺もそう思うよ\r\nそのほうが智代子らしい",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040200,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "えへへ……ありがとうございます",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040210,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "なんだか遠回りしちゃいましたけど\r\n自分に嘘ついてもしょうがないですもんね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040220,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "もう迷わないで、チョコアイドルをやっていきます！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、その意気だ！",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040230,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "チョコアイドル園田智代子、再始動！\r\nっていうか……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040240,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "園田智代子がチョコアイドル、なので！\r\nこれからはもう、トップアイドルになるまでまっしぐらです",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ファンは\r\nなんて言ってた？",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040250,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "握手会で、ですか？\r\nえっと……今日の智代子ちゃん変～とか",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040250"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040260,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "いつものチョコちゃんがいい、とか……あっ",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040270,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……そっか、ファンの人たちは\r\nチョコアイドルの私を応援してくれてるんですよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、それだけじゃない\r\nみんなは、そのままの智代子のファンなんだ",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "無理してキャラを作ってるんじゃない、\r\nありのままの姿が見たいんだよ",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040280,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "た、たしかに私、別のキャラをやるときは、\r\nかなり無理してたかもしれないです……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "キャラも大事だけど、ファンが望むものを見せることが、\r\nアイドルとしての一番の仕事なんじゃないか？",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040290,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そうでした……大事なことを忘れていました……\r\n私は、応援してくれるみんなのためにアイドルをやりたい",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040290"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040300,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ファンのみんなが好きになってくれた、\r\n無理しないでいられる、そのままの私……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040300"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040310,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "チョコアイドル園田智代子として、\r\nこれからも、また頑張ります！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "本当は気づいてるんじゃ\r\nないか？",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040320,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "うっ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040320"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040330,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさんは\r\nなんでもお見通しなんですね……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040330"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040340,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……私も、チョコアイドルしかないってことは\r\nわかってるんです",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040340"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040350,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "でもあのオーディションに落ちたのが悔しくて、\r\nちょっと他のキャラを試したくなっちゃって……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040350"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "智代子……",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040360,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……これじゃダメですよねっ\r\nきっと今の私を見ても、ファンのみんなは喜んでくれません",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040360"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040370,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "私、チョコアイドルを続けます！\r\nオーディションには、また次合格します！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040370"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。さすが智代子だ\r\nそう言うと思ってこれを用意しておいたぞ",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001040380,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "新しいオーディションの資料と、チョコ……！\r\nありがとうございます！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000104/1010001040380"
  },
  {
